  "title": "Beef Bowl (Gyudon)",
  "description": "One of the most popular rice bowl dishes in Japan, gyudon is made with beef and eggs that have been boiled in sake, mirin, and soy sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Kurumi"
  ],
